<p>Canva's Brand Kit is one of the most useful features for small teams: it keeps your logos, colours and fonts one click away, so every social post, flyer and presentation looks like it came from the same business. Here is how to set one up properly, and what a good brand kit actually contains.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

